      "transcriptionStatus": "source-verified",
      "gradingStatus": "official key verified",
      "hasFigure": false,
      "solution": "Power=40 W=0.04 kW. Energy over 180 nights=0.04×10×180=72 kWh. Cost=72×₹7=₹504. Increasing nightly hours from 10 to 12 raises the cost by (12−10)/10×100=20%. Answer: B.",
