    {
      "id": "gate-2025-ce2-ga-06",
      "number": 6,
      "year": 2025,
      "paper": "CE2",
      "subject": "General Aptitude",
      "marks": 2,
      "question": "“His life was divided between the books, his friends, and long walks. A solitary man, he worked at all hours without much method, and probably courted his fatal illness in this way. To his own name there is not much to show; but such was his liberality that he was continually helping others, and fruits of his erudition are widely scattered, and have gone to increase many a comparative stranger’s reputation.” (From E.V. Lucas’s “A Funeral”) Based only on the information provided in the above passage, which one of the following statements is true?",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "A",
          "text": "The solitary man described in the passage is dead."
        },
        {
          "label": "B",
          "text": "Strangers helped create a grand reputation for the solitary man described in the passage."
        },
        {
          "label": "C",
          "text": "The solitary man described in the passage found joy in scattering fruits."
        },
        {
          "label": "D",
          "text": "The solitary man worked in a court where he fell ill."
        }
      ],
      "sourceImage": "figures/day11-q06.png",
      "source": {
        "file": "Aptitude Sets/2025/CE2.pdf",
        "pages": [
          {
            "page": 6,
            "bbox": [
              35,
              122.09,
              565.32,
              460.63
            ]
          }
        ],
        "sha256": "cfe1d62865e0526c8f0510a411e8578d2c6784a7fff8aecfa0b3f8f6aa4ab816"
      },
      "transcriptionStatus": "source-verified",
      "gradingStatus": "official key verified",
      "hasFigure": false,
      "solution": "The passage refers to the man’s “fatal illness”; fatal means causing death. The title “A Funeral” is consistent with this. The claim supported by the passage is that he is dead (A). His learning helped others’ reputations, not the reverse.",
      "solutionStatus": "independently checked editorial solution; not an official solution",
      "type": "MCQ",
      "answer": "A",
      "answerSource": {
        "url": "https://gate2025.iitr.ac.in/doc/2025/2025_Key/CE2_Keys.pdf",
